      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont even know why i'm typing this. everything just feels so heavy lately. like no matter what i do, i'm just making things worse for everyone around me. i feel like a ghost in my own life, just taking up space and draining people. it's just exhausting to keep trying when it feels like there's no point.",
